# Committed Secret — "I know x such that x*x == y, with Pedersen commitment"
#
# Same as a simple square proof, but the secret x is bound by a
# Pedersen commitment. This adds a commitment point (D) and proof
# of knowledge (PoK) to the Groth16 proof, giving CCA security.
#
# The Aiken verifier automatically checks the commitment when
# the proof includes commitment fields.
#
# This demonstrates: Pedersen commitments on secret inputs.

Secret Int Inputs: (x)  # committed
Public Int Inputs: (y)

compute: result = x * x
check: y == result
